   "text": "Boil/abscess likely • If fluctuant, arrange incision and drainage. • Give paracetamol 500mg-1g 4-6 hourly (up to 4g in 24 hours) as needed for up to 5 days. • If swollen tender lymph nodes, multiple lesions, lesion on face, extensive surrounding infection, temperature ≥ 38°C, HIV or diabetes, give antibiotic:",
