   "text": "Herpes zoster (shingles) likely • Test for HIV 124. • Advise to keep lesions clean and dry, and to avoid skin contact with others until crusts have formed. • Give aciclovir 800mg 5 times a day (4 hourly missing the middle of the night dose) for days if:",
