   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "at night. If no response, increase by 25mg every 2 weeks, up to 75mg if needed. - If still poor response, refer. • If infected (skin red, warm, swollen): - Give cefalexin 500mg 6 hourly or flucloxacillin 500mg 6 hourly",
